      :kind :remediation :state :completed :lane "mem" :priority :critical :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789390000000 :updatedAt 1789390000000
      :motivation "stm.asl find-trunk-content uses (string-replace pair (str target ':') '') which replaces all matches everywhere in the file; stm base-hash uses string-length; vfs_merge parse-lines-to-forms splits on line-starts '(' ignoring nested expressions."
      :purpose "Implement prefix-only stripping in find-trunk-content; compute content hash instead of length; implement paren-depth counter in parse-lines-to-forms."
